   1023  f720							; A3b (2026-10-19): HOVFeatPre / PhHcrPre DELETED. Both bodies are in
   1024  f720							; this bank now, so the feature dispatchers read the record fields
   1025  f720							; straight from FetchPtr with Y = record base — no 4-field stack
   1026  f720							; shuttle (the stack floor improves by ~7 bytes on both paths).
