   1028  f720							; ==============================================================================
   1029  f720							; PhVcrEntry — PhaseBlink $81 (vcrunch) tramp target.
   1030  f720							; Record: $81, x (4px col), y (row), w (4px), h (rows). The covered TOP
   1031  f720							; rows of the bbox keep/set their pair bits (shutter closed), the open
   1032  f720							; rows clear them (shutter retracted). covered_h = CrunchClock(h) —
   1033  f720							; ping-pong with a dwell at the home stub (always ≥1 row: never gone,
   1034  f720							; user ruling 2026-10-13). Y = record class on entry; tail leaves
   1035  f720							; Y = base+2 for PhNext. Clobbers A/X/Y + LineCount/CCX/CEY.
   1036  f720							; ==============================================================================
   1037  f720							; ==============================================================================
   1038  f720							; PhVcrEntry RETIRED (2026-10-19) — bank2's PhVcrPre tail-jmps VcrShutter
   1039  f720							; (bank2) since the Phase-B rework; no tramp targets $F800 anymore (the
   1040  f720							; $FB57/$FE67 images are legacy fill). The whole $F800-$F87F block is free
   1041  f720							; for data. Vcrunch's live path = bank2 VcrShutter (PF punch + Temp/BandTab)
   1042  f720							; + bank3 VCS3 (kill); CrunchClock/CrunchMasks/PhVcApply* remain for it.
