   1057  f880							; Record: [$82, x, y(band), w(2*cells), h]. Same bank as the walker now
   1058  f880							; (A3), so fields are read DIRECTLY — the old 4-field stack shuttle is
   1059  f880							; gone and only the record base is pushed (stack floor eases by ~7 bytes).
   1060  f880							; Y = base+4 on exit (PhRec contract).
