   1209  f9de							; HOVFeatEntry — .HOVfeature tramp target ($FD7B → here). Feature-record
   1210  f9de							; dispatch for HotOverlapBody. Stack: pushed record-base Y (.HOVloop
   1211  f9de							; invariant); A = record class. Every exit tail-jmps back through a
   1212  f9de							; $FCCx pad (the pushed Y survives — HOVnext/HOVlegHit pop it).
