   1216  f9de							;		 HOVcKill (latch b7) → HOVlegHit (Temp b7 → LoseLife).
   1217  f9de							;		 b7 latch = kill ONCE per room visit (DropArm respawns at
   1218  f9de							;		 the death spot; the shutter is always-solid so a re-kill
   1219  f9de							;		 loop would be instant death). EnterRoom zeroes b7.
